    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i'll check the physical connections and the switch config on those hops. one thing though—it's really inconsistent. it'll work fine for ten minutes then just start dropping packets like crazy for a bit before settling down again. it feels almost random. could it be some kind of intermittent interference or something similar to those 'gremlins' people talk about in hardware?",
